
touch file_name.txt  --> to create file


touch jenkins.txt docker.txt terraform.txt   --> to create multiple files


touch flm{1..4}  --> to create multiple files with similar name


touch env_{dev,sit,uat,prod}    --> it will create files env_dev, env_sit, env_uat, env_prod.


find . -maxdepth 1 -type f            --> to find all regular files in current directory


find . -maxdepth 1 -type f -delete    --> to delete all regular files in current directory
